        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$x^2-8x+1=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=4\\pm\\sqrt{15}$",
          "worked": "Here $a=1$, $b=-8$, $c=1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta&=(-8)^2-4(1)(1)\\\\\\Delta&=60\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{\\Delta}}{2a}\\\\x&=\\frac{8\\pm\\sqrt{60}}{2}\\\\x&=\\frac{8\\pm2\\sqrt{15}}{2}\\\\x&=4\\pm\\sqrt{15}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      },
      {
        "id": "p24-q1-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$x^2-2x-8=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-2$ or $x=4$",
          "worked": "Here $a=1$, $b=-2$, $c=-8$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\Delta&=(-2)^2-4(1)(-8)\\\\\\Delta&=36\\end{align*}$$\n$$\\begin{align*}x&=\\frac{-b\\pm\\sqrt{\\Delta}}{2a}\\\\x&=\\frac{2\\pm\\sqrt{36}}{2}\\\\x&=\\frac{2\\pm6}{2}\\\\x&=4\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=-2\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 55
      },
      {
        "id": "p24-q1-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$x^2-3x-1=0$",
